Package: persona
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: John Davis <john@johndavis.dev>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: sudo, iproute2, iptables, kmod, rsync, git, ca-certificates, e2fsprogs (>= 1.47.1), libarchive13t64
Recommends: docker-ce | docker.io, gh
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/johndavisdotdev/persona
Description: Claude Code personas in containers or Firecracker microVMs
 persona builds, spawns, and multiplexes Claude Code "personas": minimal
 Debian images with the plugins, skills, and MCP servers a role needs.
 .
 On this platform instances run as Firecracker microVMs by default. The
 package bundles Firecracker @FC_VERSION@ and its jailer, a guest kernel, the
 persona-vm root wrapper (allowed via sudo for the persona-vm group only), and
 a shared network namespace that gives VMs internet access but not the LAN.
